00:04:36.720 --> 00:04:42.180
And when we're already talking about 56 28,
I mean, Trump still winning but 56 28 this

00:04:42.180 --> 00:04:48.700
far out from 2024 signals that DeSantis really
could be a very solid challenger to Trump.

00:04:48.700 --> 00:04:54.350
And I think Democrats have to hope for absolutely
anything they can to help them out.

00:04:54.350 --> 00:04:55.350
What will ultimately happen?

00:04:55.350 --> 00:04:59.480
I think we won't know until after the 2022
midterms, and this is again why I continued

00:04:59.480 --> 00:05:02.920
telling you guys in in some way.

00:05:02.920 --> 00:05:05.580
Trump seems determined to run in 2024.

00:05:05.580 --> 00:05:09.530
Even at the CPAC speech over the weekend,
Trump said in the clearest terms we've heard

00:05:09.530 --> 00:05:10.660
