00:05:14.790 --> 00:05:20.890
I have not heard Trump more clearly and forcefully
say I plan to run than that.

00:05:20.890 --> 00:05:28.850
At the same time, I do believe that if the
Trumpian wing and Trump's endorses get crushed

00:05:28.850 --> 00:05:32.380
