00:05:39.620 --> 00:05:44.380
And of course, the question is, will Trump
believe that he can win, or will Trump come

00:05:44.380 --> 00:05:46.830
to realize that he's destined to lose?

00:05:46.830 --> 00:05:49.331
And on that basis, what will he decide in
the immediate?

00:05:49.331 --> 00:05:54.380
The best thing we can do is minimize losses
in November.

00:05:54.380 --> 00:06:02.640
Maximize wins if there are wins to be had
and foment this split between DeSantis and

00:06:02.640 --> 00:06:06.490
Trump because we have very little else to
be shooting for right now, I wish it were.

00:06:06.490 --> 00:06:07.600
